    "AI 设定检查只读，不生成回复、不消耗模型用量。账号凭证和 API 密钥不会显示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 设定检查只读，不生成回复、不消耗模型用量。账号凭证和 API 密钥不会显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 設定檢查只讀，不生成回復、不消耗模型用量。帳號憑證和 API 密鑰不會顯示。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI inspection is read-only. It doesn't generate replies or use credits. Account credentials and API keys aren't shown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
