    "也可以直接说“坐下”“上身前倾 6 度”或“把腿收一点”。每种姿势的细节会单独记住。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以直接说“坐下”“上身前倾 6 度”或“把腿收一点”。每种姿势的细节会单独记住。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以直接說“坐下”“上身前傾 6 度”或“把腿收一點”。每種姿勢的細節會單獨記住。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also say “sit down”, “lean forward 6 degrees” or “bring your legs closer”. Details are remembered for each pose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
