    "账户注销会删除云端账户资料、角色订阅及平台保存的对话。此操作无法撤销。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账户注销会删除云端账户资料、角色订阅及平台保存的对话。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "註銷帳戶會刪除雲端帳戶資料、角色訂閱及平台儲存的對話。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleting your account removes cloud profile data, subscriptions and platform conversations. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
